# Favicon + PWA icon set lives here (served at /icons/*).
# Expected files (from RealFaviconGenerator):
#   favicon.svg
#   favicon-32x32.png, favicon-16x16.png
#   apple-touch-icon.png (180x180, opaque background)
#   android-chrome-192x192.png, android-chrome-512x512.png
#   site.webmanifest
# favicon.ico stays at public/ root (implicit /favicon.ico requests).
